{"id": "70221", "title": "重生之名媛", "author": "盛世清歌", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70221.htm", "intro": "斐茵作为集富三代、官三代、红三代为一身的名门千金。\r\n    却因为父母离异，一朝成为爹不疼娘不爱的弃女。\r\n    她恨，她怒，却又无可奈何。\r\n    最终被人害得惨死，弃尸荒野。\r\n    重来一世，她回到父母离异之前。\r\n    且看她如何与继父、、私生姐姐争夺父母之爱。（其实是一生黑！）\r\n    一步步走向真正的名媛之路！\r\n   一句话文案：神也无法阻挡她的名媛之路！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70221", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔子 身死凄凉", "file": "10897483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "001 重生闹剧", "file": "10897484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002 离婚事宜", "file": "10897485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003 金钱买卖", "file": "10897486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004 修改合约", "file": "10897487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005 遇见仇敌", "file": "10897488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006 刀砍仇敌", "file": "10897489.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007 合约到手", "file": "10897490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008 防止家暴", "file": "10897491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009 男主出现", "file": "10897492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010 混乱场面", "file": "10897493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011 大伯养子", "file": "10897494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012 致远身世", "file": "10897495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013 夜半出门", "file": "10897496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014 镊子拔刺", "file": "10897497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015 冷面嘴贱", "file": "10897498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016 两人玩耍（上）", "file": "10897499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017 两人玩耍（下）", "file": "10897500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018 天生警觉", "file": "10897501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019 初次上学", "file": "10897502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020 快餐风波", "file": "10897503.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021 争抢蛋挞", "file": "10897504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "022 间接接吻